Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.16,VO,,0,0,0,,FRIDAY NIGHT. I DECIDED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.16,0:00:02.68,VO,,0,0,0,,TO STOP. I'D LEAVE MAX
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.68,0:00:03.86,VO,,0,0,0,,A NOTE, TELL HIM THE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.86,0:00:05.43,VO,,0,0,0,,TRUTH, AND GO HOME.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.49,0:00:07.86,SKYE,,0,0,0,,DEAR MAX. THE GHOST WAS ME. SORRY.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.11,0:00:10.24,SKYE,,0,0,0,,ALSO, YOUR DAD'S PANCAKES ARE AMAZING.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.06,0:00:13.75,MAX,,0,0,0,,SKYE? ASK SKYE TO THE DANCE?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.98,0:00:15.99,MAX,,0,0,0,,OKAY. DON'T TELL ANYONE.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.30,0:00:17.78,MAX,,0,0,0,,SKYE IS THE WORST...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.59,0:00:21.14,SKYE,,0,0,0,,THE WORST. RIGHT. GOT IT.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.26,0:00:23.37,LILY,,0,0,0,,WHAT HAPPENED? DID HE SEE YOU?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.47,0:00:25.48,SKYE,,0,0,0,,WORSE. YOUR BROTHER THINKS I'M THE WORST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.64,0:00:26.13,LILY,,0,0,0,,HE SAID THAT?
